-----------------

- capxsd/CAP-v1.2.xsd: the OASIS CAP 1.2 schema as OASIS publishes it
  (https://docs.oasis-open.org/emergency/cap/v1.2/CAP-v1.2.xsd), byte for
  byte (its SHA-256 is checked by a test), "Copyright OASIS Open 2010 All
  Rights Reserved", copied under the OASIS copyright policy, which lets
  OASIS documents be copied and furnished to others unmodified with their
  notice.
- interop/testdata/edxl-de-v2.0-cs02/ and
  interop/testdata/DE_2.0_Example_Appendix_B2_9.xml: the EDXL-DE 2.0
  Committee Specification 02 schemas and one example, unmodified,
  "Copyright (c) OASIS Open 2013. All Rights Reserved", same policy; test
  data of the test-only interop module.
- interop/testdata/w3c/xml.xsd: the W3C schema for the XML namespace
  (https://www.w3.org/2001/xml.xsd), unmodified, under the W3C Software
  and Document License; test data.

